  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.0/linux-3.0.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.0/patch-3.0.101.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.0/patch-3.0.101-rt130.patch.xz




